<title>HONG KONG: Allied Group interim net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Allied Group interim net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.9	    vs 2.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  0.322 loss   vs 12.97 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    87.95	  vs 89.86</p>
<p>    Turnover		     322.40	 vs 255.57</p>
<p>    Company name		 Allied Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Allied Group is a corporate management and property development group. Net is after exceptional loss dervived from professional fees incurred in connection with the investigation ordered by the Financial Secretary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
